# Frontend Docker Build

## NPM registry (build)

`main.Dockerfile` and `dev.Dockerfile` default `NPM_REGISTRY_URL` to the **same Liara mirror as the backend**:

`https://package-mirror.liara.ir/repository/npm/`

Override at build time when needed:

```bash
docker build --build-arg NPM_REGISTRY_URL="https://…" -f apps/frontend/main.Dockerfile .
```

`COREPACK_NPM_REGISTRY`, `npm_config_registry`, and `pnpm config set registry` all use this URL so Corepack can fetch `pnpm@10.28.2` and `pnpm install` uses the same mirror.

## CI defaults

- **GitLab** (`build:frontend` in `.gitlab-ci.yml`): `--build-arg NPM_REGISTRY_URL="${NPM_REGISTRY_URL:-https://package-mirror.liara.ir/repository/npm/}"`
- **GitHub Actions** (`frontend-cicd.yml`): same Liara URL as fallback when `secrets.NPM_REGISTRY_URL` is unset

Set the `NPM_REGISTRY_URL` CI variable to override for all pipelines.

## Docker Hub / base images

Base images use the Arvan Docker mirror prefix (`docker.arvancloud.ir/node:22-alpine`). See [docker-hub-mirror-arvan.mdc](docker-hub-mirror-arvan.mdc).

## Node version

Frontend Dockerfiles use **Node 22** (`node:22-alpine`) for Next.js cache handler / Web Streams compatibility under load. Backend uses Node 20 for Strapi 4.x engine compatibility.
